 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/10/10 08:36| 00 | 300| 014| 0369| 0024| 0337| 0412|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/10/10 08:36| 01 | 305| 068| 0367| 0072| 0245| 0568|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/10/09 19:12| 02 | 253| 016| 0269| 0038| 0238| 0351|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/10/09 19:12| 03 | 298| 030| 0211| 0063| 0111| 0339|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/10/09 14:48| 01 | 321| 008| 0543| 0039| 0477| 0558|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/10/09 14:36| 03 | 292| 078| 027"
